      "content": "i just don't want to deal with the hospital thing if i don't have to. the ER is so expensive and it's such a huge hassle. honestly, it's really rare for me to have it this bad. i'll just take some extra ibuprofen and some of my migraine prescription and see how i feel in an hour. if it happens again i'll call someone, but can't i just monitor it at home for now since the symptoms actually went away?",
